=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# SSH Login ####################################################$
$
  [+] SSH Login            Configured root disallowed$
  [+] SSH Auth             Configured key-only auth$
  [+] SSH Port             Configured non-default (2230)$
$
  SSH Configuration --------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Root SSH Login       Disallowed$
   -  Password Login       Off$
   -  SSH Port             2230$
   -  Allowed Users        Anyone$
   -  Logged in as         george, by key$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Allow root key-only  Root logs in by key alone$
   2) Password login on    Let passwords log in again$
   3) Change SSH port      Now 2230$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Enter your choice [0-3 or q]: 0$
$

